    "Raw sparse counter absence is not proof that an event did not occur or that a field is universally supported; examples only prove presence in the stated seasons/weeks.",
    "Yahoo stat83 is IDP Extra Point Returned. No corresponding individual-player counter was observed in2025week4 even though DAL def_2pt=1. Do not invent idp_2pt or copy a team counter to a player.",
    "Yahoo bonuses use cumulative thresholds, while Sleeper precomputed yardage milestone flags represent nonstacking bands. Apply Yahoo targets to actual weekly yardage rather than substituting Sleeper bonus flags.",
    "No Yahoo from/to bonus schema was observed. The maintained YFPY Bonus model documents target and points only; nested wire envelopes require an actual league bonus capture.",
    "Yahoo38 includes special-teams solo tackles for the defensive players checked, but whether Yahoo awards IDP categories to offensive players is unverified. All IDP mappings remain pending provider-specific applicability support.",
    "Sleeper idp_ff and st_ff overlap in observed records and must not be blindly summed; some st_fum_rec records lack idp_fum_rec, so different special-teams categories need separate treatment.",
    "Cross-provider stat corrections differ: in2022week18 Yahoo reported Christian Harris7solo/3assist while Sleeper reported6/4, and Jarrad Davis5assists while Sleeper reported4. Actual Yahoo player_points remain the authority for Yahoo score reconciliation."
